    "detailed_description": "<strong>CarKour</strong> is the first game dedicated to car parking games, and it is a great challenge for you to test your skill in controlling and driving the car to reach the <strong>happy ending.</strong><br><br>Contains many <strong>hints, marks and stickers</strong> that are there to help you pass the<u> difficult obstacles</u><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2245630/extras/2563d8aeacd00aca63e99f68d923ce8b.poster.avif?t=1672481000\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2245630/extras/2563d8aeacd00aca63e99f68d923ce8b.webm?t=1672481000\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2245630/extras/2563d8aeacd00aca63e99f68d923ce8b.mp4?t=1672481000\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><br>Contains the feature of bending forward and backward during high jumps using the<strong> Q</strong> and <strong>E</strong> keys.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2245630/extras/6985cee4379e7609dba48c7d0296b701.poster.avif?t=1672481000\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2245630/extras/6985cee4379e7609dba48c7d0296b701.webm?t=1672481000\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2245630/extras/6985cee4379e7609dba48c7d0296b701.mp4?t=1672481000\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Does not contain</strong> Check Points, <u>so every loss is considered a start over</u><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2245630/extras/2870eb5c24c4f2cbed255112572541cb.poster.avif?t=1672481000\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2245630/extras/2870eb5c24c4f2cbed255112572541cb.webm?t=1672481000\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2245630/extras/2870eb5c24c4f2cbed255112572541cb.mp4?t=1672481000\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><br>Contains the main control keys for a car , inside and outside cameras , in addition to the car Respawn<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2245630/extras/859dbaa2dfa9114d5e5e8c17ba1e9dcd.poster.avif?t=1672481000\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2245630/extras/859dbaa2dfa9114d5e5e8c17ba1e9dcd.webm?t=1672481000\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2245630/extras/859dbaa2dfa9114d5e5e8c17ba1e9dcd.mp4?t=1672481000\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
    "about_the_game": "<strong>CarKour</strong> is the first game dedicated to car parking games, and it is a great challenge for you to test your skill in controlling and driving the car to reach the <strong>happy ending.</strong><br><br>Contains many <strong>hints, marks and stickers</strong> that are there to help you pass the<u> difficult obstacles</u><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2245630/extras/2563d8aeacd00aca63e99f68d923ce8b.poster.avif?t=1672481000\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2245630/extras/2563d8aeacd00aca63e99f68d923ce8b.webm?t=1672481000\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2245630/extras/2563d8aeacd00aca63e99f68d923ce8b.mp4?t=1672481000\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><br>Contains the feature of bending forward and backward during high jumps using the<strong> Q</strong> and <strong>E</strong> keys.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2245630/extras/6985cee4379e7609dba48c7d0296b701.poster.avif?t=1672481000\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2245630/extras/6985cee4379e7609dba48c7d0296b701.webm?t=1672481000\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2245630/extras/6985cee4379e7609dba48c7d0296b701.mp4?t=1672481000\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Does not contain</strong> Check Points, <u>so every loss is considered a start over</u><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2245630/extras/2870eb5c24c4f2cbed255112572541cb.poster.avif?t=1672481000\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2245630/extras/2870eb5c24c4f2cbed255112572541cb.webm?t=1672481000\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2245630/extras/2870eb5c24c4f2cbed255112572541cb.mp4?t=1672481000\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><br>Contains the main control keys for a car , inside and outside cameras , in addition to the car Respawn<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2245630/extras/859dbaa2dfa9114d5e5e8c17ba1e9dcd.poster.avif?t=1672481000\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2245630/extras/859dbaa2dfa9114d5e5e8c17ba1e9dcd.webm?t=1672481000\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2245630/extras/859dbaa2dfa9114d5e5e8c17ba1e9dcd.mp4?t=1672481000\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
